CIV1 VISUAL APPLICATION - BOOT AND SETUP
RANGE: CIV1-UI-001..006
SOURCE SETS: ../ascii/00_boot_setup.ascii + ../ansii/00_boot_setup.ansii

Purpose: concrete frame references for the static boot/setup layouts. These frames are additive; the original scene wireframes remain the final readable state.

[CIV1-UI-001] TITLE SCREEN
Effects: FRAME.DRAW, TEXT.CENTER_REVEAL, INPUT.PROMPT_PULSE
ASCII frames:
01
+---------------------------------+
|                                 |
|                                 |
|                                 |
+---------------------------------+
02
+---------------------------------+
|          C I V I L I Z A T I O N|
|                                 |
|                                 |
+---------------------------------+
03
+---------------------------------+
|          C I V I L I Z A T I O N|
|      BUILD AN EMPIRE THAT WILL  |
|        STAND THE TEST OF TIME   |
+---------------------------------+
04
+---------------------------------+
|          C I V I L I Z A T I O N|
|      BUILD AN EMPIRE THAT WILL  |
|        STAND THE TEST OF TIME   |
|          [ PRESS ANY KEY ]      |
+---------------------------------+
Fallback: frame 04, no animation.

[CIV1-UI-002] MAIN MENU
Effects: FRAME.DRAW, CURSOR.PULSE, MENU.REVEAL
Frames:
> START A GAME
  LOAD A GAME
  OPTIONS
  QUIT
then
> START A GAME
  LOAD A GAME
  OPTIONS
  QUIT
and cursor alternates > / * at 250 ms while focus remains.

[CIV1-UI-003] WORLD CREATION
Effects: PANEL.REVEAL, OPTION.SELECT, VALUE.CHANGE
ASCII sequence:
LAND MASS   (*) Normal
CLIMATE     (*) Normal
TEMPERATURE (*) Temperate
AGE         (*) 4 Billion Years
When an option changes, briefly render:
LAND MASS   (*) Normal  ->  LAND MASS   (*) LARGE
Use a one-line delta marker: [CHANGED].

[CIV1-UI-004] DIFFICULTY SELECTION
Effects: CURSOR.MOVE, OPTION.SELECT, SELECTION.CONFIRM
Frame pair:
> EASY
  NORMAL
  HARD
then selected:
> [X] HARD

[CIV1-UI-005] CIVILIZATION / LEADER SELECTION
Effects: PORTRAIT.REVEAL, CURSOR.PULSE, SELECTION.CONFIRM
ASCII portrait reveal:
[        ]
[   O    ]
[  /|\   ]
[  / \   ]
then faction/leader name appears below. Selection settles to static portrait.

[CIV1-UI-006] OPENING / DAWN OF CIVILIZATION
Effects: TEXT.TYPEWRITER, FADE_SYMBOLIC, SCENE.TRANSITION
Frame 01:
DAWN OF
Frame 02:
DAWN OF CIVILIZATION
Frame 03:
DAWN OF CIVILIZATION
--------------------
Your people stand ready...
Frame 04 holds until CONTINUE.

ASCII capability rule: no cursor-control is required; frame replacement is sufficient.
Accessibility: all animations must be skippable by keypress and final text must remain visible.